### What about retries and failure handling?

Each pipeline stage is retryable. Failed transcodes go to a DLQ for inspection.

```java
package com.bank.video.worker;

public class TranscodeRetryHandler {

    public void onFailure(TranscodeJob job, Exception e, int attempt) {
        if (attempt < 3) {
            queue.publishWithDelay("video-processing", job, attempt * 30_000L);
        } else {
            deadLetterQueue.publish(job);
            metadataRepo.updateStatus(job.getVideoId(), "FAILED");
        }
    }
}
```

